{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>&quot;The Darkness That Envelops All&quot;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Immerse yourself in an emotional story about a difficult family tragedy. A story where every step you take can have an unexpected outcome. Every diary fragment you find, every note you leave, and every dark sound reveals more and more of the storyline to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Average playthrough time: 30 minutes</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3296370/extras/dark.gif?t=1743885073\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u201cCursed New Year\u201d</strong> will immerse you in the atmosphere of a gloomy house and allow you to go through a palette of bright emotions, and photorealistic graphics and high-quality sound will help you with this. The game is focused on a constant tense atmosphere and strong, well-timed screamers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A young girl, Sarah, spent most of her conscious life surrounded by two loving parents, but the tragedy that happened inside had an immense impact on the fate of each family member.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3296370/extras/lightning.gif?t=1743885073\" /> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Game features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-Genre &quot;Walking simulator&quot;;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-Game graphics and atmosphere are as close to realism as possible;<br>-During the game you will be accompanied by atmospheric sound effects;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-The game contains a well-developed plot that you can investigate during the gameplay;</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Welcome","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3296370/2d6b75239b6e2f842582118363b9effeadd561be.jpg"},{"name":"Strange dream","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3296370/fe44d3e281fb1fc8d942470d4f18e0e01be6550c.jpg"},{"name":"The end?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3296370/98862efc070029259d5755ad8a18e4f37480da9f.jpg"}],"total":3},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3296370?t=1743885073","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3296370?t=1743885073","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3296370/e5e5cce355faa9f24235ea91bf190532fd6e4c02/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743885073","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3296370/e5e5cce355faa9f24235ea91bf190532fd6e4c02/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743885073","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This game contains scary images, scenes of violence and scenes with a hint of suicide. The game is not recommended for people suffering from epilepsy and heart problems. The authors do not take responsibility for possible consequences that arise after the game."},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>&quot;The Darkness That Envelops All&quot;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Immerse yourself in an emotional story about a difficult family tragedy. A story where every step you take can have an unexpected outcome. Every diary fragment you find, every note you leave, and every dark sound reveals more and more of the storyline to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Average playthrough t